#. [world_entry]: id=s1_monolith
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:4
msgid "Monolith of Seerwick"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s1_monolith
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:6
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>\n"
"This memorial stone was erected by me, Iah'ralin, in solemn tribute unto all the folk of Seerwick who did perish by the actions of she who is called Awyana of Blackmore, through her incidental folly and most grievous recklessness.\n"
"\n"
"May they find eternal rest, and may they trouble not this land with any longing for vengeance.</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s2_haralin
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:14
msgid "Old Journal"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s2_haralin
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:16
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>\n"
"From an old journal of Haralin, the peasant of Seerwick \n"
"\n"
"This so-called 'magic' is truly amazing. I can't say I fully understand it yet, but I swear by the Light that what I do know is enough to see how much good it can bring to people. And evil...\n"
"\n"
"Sometimes I wonder: what decides what is good and what is evil? Is good something that my heart tells me? Or is it simply what is accepted by others?</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_tablet_1
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:26
msgid "Tablet of Prophecies (Truth)"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_tablet_1
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:28
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>\n"
"There's always good, and evil too,\n"
"Yet both are <b>one</b>, forever true.\n"
"But who has judged how they align?\n"
"And who decreed what's <b>evil</b> sign?</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_tablet_2
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:37
msgid "Tablet of Prophecies (Conflict)"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_tablet_2
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:39
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>	\n"
"When <b>island</b> suffers undead threat,\n"
"Will kindness halt their ruthless spread?\n"
"When that one wakes the Land of Dead,\n"
"Will hero's glow bring doom to dread?\n"
"And when the <b>two</b> in battle stand,\n"
"Does one still hold Light's guiding hand?</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_tablet_3
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:50
msgid "Tablet of Prophecies (Choice)"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_tablet_3
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:52
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>	\n"
"No single path is bathed in light,\n"
"There's only <b>goal</b> in your sight.\n"
"For why you walk, the cause you strive,\n"
"That's what <b>you</b>'ll reap when you arrive.</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_arvit
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:61
msgid "Note from Esten Mines #1"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_arvit
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:63
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>\n"
"From the journal of Aravit, the overseer of the Western Far Caves. \n"
"\n"
"...Sometimes, I be seein’ shapes on that side, like statues o’ folk standin’ there or somethin'... Who knows, but my men say there be wicked spirits livin’ in these caves. I don’t believe ‘em, but still...</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_penella
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:71
msgid "Note from Esten Mines #2"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_penella
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:73
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>\n"
"From the diary of Penella, Master Alin's wife.\n"
"\n"
"...I hate them monsters fer what they done to my poor husband! I wanna make them all pay for him, but I gotta play along, else they’ll eat me too...\n"
"\n"
"I gotta get outta this hole, away from these filthy miners an’ murderers, away from damned Esten. What ‘bout Southbay outskirts? Should be much safer there, long as I live to make it...</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_unnamed
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:83
msgid "Note from Esten Mines #3"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_unnamed
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:85
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>\n"
"From the notes of unnamed miner.\n"
"		\n"
"Esten’s fallen, undead things all ‘round, an’ our own folk gone full mad! They done kilt our master, an’ then they started eatin’ people — P E O P L E!!! Me an’ a few o’ mine, we makin’ a run fer the spider tunnel. They say beasts took over part o’ the mines there, like that bastard Caror cursed the land, but we’ll break through!</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_eddek
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:94
msgid "Note from Esten Mines #4"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_eddek
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:96
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='white'>\n"
"From the notes of Eddek, a miner.\n"
"		\n"
"Them cursed spiders done grabbed me, blast ‘em! Right ‘fore I blacked out from their poison, I saw ‘em snatch up Yran an’ Madreor. Rest of ‘em likely long gone, leavin’ us behind. Can’t blame ‘em—what was they supposed to do? Kill them big ol’ beasts with pickaxes? Ha! Sure.\n"
"\n"
"So, I woke up wrapped in their webs, still breathin’, still got my hammer. Started breakin’ away at the rock bit by bit till I clawed my way to a tunnel. Thought I was free, but nah. I see the way out, but there’s a damn chasm in my path. Ain’t no way I can jump it, an’ I can’t break through neither — lost my hammer in the dark...</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_unnamed_2
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:107
msgid "Note from Esten Mines #5"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_unnamed_2
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:109
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='21000' color='white'>\n"
"From the notes of unnamed miner.\n"
"		\n"
"An’ we done busted through them cursed spiders... but not all of us. Not even close... Them beasts snatched one... then another... then one more... Three o’ ours, gone! But that weren’t even the worst. We figured we’d poke ‘round these mines, but somethin’s changed. Like a quake hit, an’ now there’s critters crawlin’ all over—things I ain’t never seen. We was headin’ for the Far Caves, thought maybe someone made it, but then bats came swarmin’, horrible sounds ‘round there, an’ then... then they got Gliravan. So we backed off to Second Camp. Only me an’ Ywyn left now. We’re leavin’ this cursed place, gotta find a way out... Think I see some light yonder...\n"
"\n"
"We found a way out, but when we got near the lake, somethin’ huge grabbed Ywyn, tentacles or somethin’! An’ me... I just ran. I heard her screamin’, beggin’ me t’ come back, then she started cursin’ me... But what was I supposed t’ do?! Ain’t no weapon, ain’t no pickax — nothin’! If only... If only I coulda... I’d have saved every last one o’ ya. Yran, Eddek, Madreor, Gliravan, an’ now Ywyn too... I swear, if I make it outta here, I’ll get revenge on Caror! Alright... now I’ll grab my stash an’ make a run for it. Marked it all on the map. I can do this... Wait! I hear voices! People, they gettin’ closer! That’s gotta be our boys — it’s the Esten March!</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_tozarii
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:119
msgid "Note from Esten Mines #6"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_tozarii
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:121
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='26000' color='black'>\n"
"From the journal of Tozarii, the overseer of the Eastern Far Caves. \n"
"\n"
"...the ground here has always been calm, but now for some reason there are strong earthquakes, many of my workers have been crushed, may their souls rest in peace.\n"
"\n"
"The connection with the other mining camps has been lost, so we'll just sit here and wait for help to come.\n"
"\n"
"Well, there will be no help. Esten has been seized, and the remnants of its defenders are fleeing in fear in the direction of the Western Far Caves. I let some people go with them, but I'll stay here, I think it's safer.</span>"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_rurohin
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:133
msgid "Note from Esten Mines #7"
msgstr ""

#. [world_entry]: id=s6_rurohin
#: Chasing_the_Light/journey/world.cfg:135
msgid ""
"<span font-family='Oldania ADF Std' font-size='21000' color='white'>\n"
"From the notes of General Rurohin, Commander of the Clearwater Army\n"
"\n"
"My warriors held the walls with valiant resolve, when—out of nowhere these abominations began appearing in the very heart of the city! How is such a thing even possible? I ordered a retreat to the mountains, for according to our scouts, there were mines where we could make our stand.\n"
"\n"
"Yet we could not find them — only the entrance to some cavern, where we stumbled upon a miners’ encampment, sheltering many terrified souls. We took most with us, yet some chose to remain behind. There was no time to persuade them, it was their choice, and their folly.\n"
"\n"
"Now, we have entrenched ourselves deeper within these caves. We shall hold out to the last warrior, but how much longer can we endure? I can already feel it — HE is coming. This will be our final battle.\n"
"\n"
"This is the end! Only a handful of wounded soldiers remain at my side, and yet... that monstrosity still advance! And he is alone! Just one, yet no weapon we wield can so much as wound this Caror! Not a single man has managed to harm him! I must face him myself. Either I shall put an end to this nightmare, or I shall perish trying!\n"
"\n"
"At-tack... of en-nemy... re-pe-led... LO-RD CAROR... has... left... Es-sten...\n"
"\n"
"But... around... still... many... much... more... Wes-folk...\n"
"\n"
"... De-fense... of Es-sten... con-ti-nues... War-riors... con-ti-nue... the fight...</span>"
msgstr ""

