msgid "Bone Essedum"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Bone Essedum, race=undead
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Bone_Essedum.cfg:38
msgid "Having established their power, the Lich Lords have raised the greatest heroes of the Wesfolk from their graves and formed a personal guard. Riding a terrifying chariot, with an impressive claymore in hand, these undead are as deadly in unlife as they were in life."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Bone_Essedum.cfg:52
msgid "claymore"
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=cold
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Bone_Essedum.cfg:62
msgid "wail"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Bone Skeleton, race=undead
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Bone_Skeleton.cfg:4
msgid "Bone Skeleton"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Bone Skeleton, race=undead
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Bone_Skeleton.cfg:27
msgid "Bone Skeletons, clad in bone armour and armed with two bone maces, are an awe-inspiring tool of doom imployed by the great undead overlords. They are slower than the most of undead but that only adds to the horror of meeting one. Lagging behind the ranks of front-liners, these monsters wait for a perfect moment to strike the victims in any breach in their formation. Their armour makes them even less vulnerable to any kind of physical damage and their big bone maces deal heavy blows to their confused enemies."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Bone_Skeleton.cfg:39
msgid "bone mace"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Undead Captain, race=undead
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Captain.cfg:4
msgid "Undead Captain"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Undead Captain, race=undead
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Captain.cfg:18
msgid "Captains are masters in life, but in death they may be slaves to a necromancer. Through sheer force of habit, an undead captain continues to exude authority even if all his other memories have been lost."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Captain.cfg:27
msgid "saber"
msgstr ""

#. [illuminates]: id=deillumination
#: Chasing_the_Light/units/Wesfolk/Caror.cfg:18
